  Qwen team, Alibaba Cloud, Apache License 2.0.

Granite-Docling 258M
  IBM, Apache License 2.0. GGUF conversion by ggml-org.

Kokoro 82M v1.0
  hexgrad, Apache License 2.0.
  ONNX conversion and voice packs by onnx-community.

